{"title":"The Investor Who Sees The Future","synopsis":"Setelah mengalami kecelakaan di militer, tokoh utama Kang Jinhu mendapatkan kemampuan untuk meramalkan masa depan. Dia memutuskan untuk menggunakan kemampuan ini untuk berinvestasi di berbagai perusahaan dan menghasilkan uang, dengan tujuan untuk menjadi investor nomor satu di dunia. Sejauh mana batas-batas pandangan ke depan yang dimilikinya? Lebih dari sekadar investasi, ia juga menyentuh ekonomi, politik, korporasi, dan bahkan urusan global. Mulai sekarang, dia membentuk kembali dunia keuangan!","alternative_title":"Prescient Investor, Foresighting Investor, 미래를 보는 투자자","author":"Park Sungho","artist":"Yang Song","genres":["Drama","Shounen","Supernatural"],"chapters":[{"id":"9eb8f3f4-d4f1-43ce-aee9-0b0249b36607","number":"100","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"id":"5200a43a-9fab-45a2-9ee7-6057ebc05851","number":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-06-14","images":[]},{"id":"90f2fbb1-1dfb-4e38-b39b-84a0ac51c82a","number":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"43b05989-9c85-4e1a-9bb2-69050ce36e97","number":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2026-06-10","images":[]},{"id":"72840e9b-7f4d-4157-88f4-9d146f6ed5c6","number":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2026-05-23","images":[]},{"id":"20570530-8051-45eb-a8e0-8c7ad9d17cf2","number":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2026-05-17","images":[]},{"id":"0fe9e4df-cff9-4852-87aa-ea57551d2c8e","number":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-05-09","images":[]},{"id":"be6cf5e2-a9fb-4319-844b-66557b7d17c7","number":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-05-01","images":[]},{"id":"8987daf5-a68f-4b6e-995c-ac85bab29bbf","number":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-04-25","images":[]},{"id":"d482c2a3-d908-470c-a244-9d23c47326c5","number":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-04-17","images":[]},{"id":"9f9330b4-2669-4c2a-a20c-e09191f4897a","number":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-04-09","images":[]},{"id":"6b504886-845